{"parents": [{"link": "../", "title": "Available Types"}], "prev": {"link": "../LocationAddress/", "title": "LocationAddress"}, "next": {"link": "../StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue/", "title": "StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue"}, "title": "StoryAreaType", "meta": null, "body": "<section id=\"storyareatype\">\n<h1>StoryAreaType<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#storyareatype\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaType\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">pyrogram.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaType</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaType\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>This object describes the type of a clickable area on a story.</p>\n<p>Currently, it can be one of:</p>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Bots</span><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeLocation/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeLocation\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeLocation\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeLocation</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeSuggestedReaction/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeSuggestedReaction\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeSuggestedReaction\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeSuggestedReaction</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeLink/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeLink\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeLink\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeLink</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeWeather/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeWeather\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeWeather\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeWeather</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeUniqueGift/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeUniqueGift\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeUniqueGift\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeUniqueGift</span></code></a></p></li>\n</ul>\n<strong>Usable by</strong>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-check\" style=\"color: var(--color-green)\"></i> Users</span>\n<span class=\"usable-by\"><i class=\"fa-solid fa-xmark\" style=\"color: var(--color-red)\"></i> Bots</span><ul class=\"simple\">\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeMessage/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeMessage\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeMessage\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeMessage</span></code></a></p></li>\n<li><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"../StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue/#pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue\" title=\"pyrogram.types.StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue</span></code></a></p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["api/types/StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue", "StoryAreaTypeFoundVenue", "N", "next"], ["api/types/LocationAddress", "LocationAddress", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "", "toc": "<ul>\n<